{"id":"27132055","type":"page","ari":"ari:cloud:confluence:8702f96a-1aec-4506-80f6-c8b4c62822fc:page/27132055","base64EncodedAri":"YXJpOmNsb3VkOmNvbmZsdWVuY2U6ODcwMmY5NmEtMWFlYy00NTA2LTgwZjYtYzhiNGM2MjgyMmZjOmNvbnRlbnQvMjcxMzIwNTU=","status":"current","title":"Periodic Billing Run - Listing","macroRenderedOutput":{},"body":{"storage":{"value":"<p local-id=\"74faa8b9-50dd-4fe2-b09e-5171c545d156\"><strong>User Story</strong></p><p local-id=\"7f4b450c-1537-4623-88e7-6e75bc19f114\">&nbsp;</p><p local-id=\"fe10dddb-4f76-4b6b-8b0e-8e5d7ba69223\"><strong>As a</strong> system user</p><p local-id=\"1be83e6e-1bc5-4a36-a18b-a9dca02ca402\"><strong>I want to</strong> be able to view Period Billing Run's listing page</p><p local-id=\"0460b824-63fd-4620-8c62-992493ad554a\"><strong>So that</strong> I will be able to get information about all periodic billing runs</p><p local-id=\"0410a553-3f85-4648-9ea2-85ff16e14f02\">&nbsp;</p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"257\" ac:original-width=\"468\" ac:custom-width=\"true\" ac:local-id=\"cb2fbb3c-bf1b-4438-9787-128f22f4aaaf\" ac:width=\"468\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Picture1.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p local-id=\"bd69aebc-6cb1-4cf8-b18b-b13cfae41cd1\"><strong>Acceptance criteria:</strong></p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"2e1c40de-f27e-418e-a870-dc815db147c3\"><li local-id=\"1c07db27-86a5-462e-bc81-a739871ae2b2\"><p local-id=\"0494cbb7-f093-4317-a1bd-7a1ae003c37d\">Check system user permission to view Periodic Billing Run's listing</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"8e172834-f0db-46bf-92fb-6d59a50102ed\"><li local-id=\"acc770e0-171e-46b7-b5df-d7cfd7626c48\"><p local-id=\"eb203f12-8a7d-4cf9-a12d-83b23a99a644\">View Periodic Billing Run</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"59e0f00a-22ca-40a8-b08e-69d37fbfec1d\"><li local-id=\"ad9719f6-9b7a-460e-8557-41db3f214042\"><p local-id=\"baa5cc9b-7a6b-4564-8750-2f360bf56827\">Allows to see all Periodic Billing Runs in the system</p></li></ol></li></ol></li><li local-id=\"f53cc111-3973-4611-a07a-e8d0a1ea5b22\"><p local-id=\"9d761abd-e507-44ca-8dfb-ed43858fc365\">Should load list of all Periodic Billing Runs in the system</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"323181ae-812d-4bc6-8f3d-d3fa91e70da1\"><li local-id=\"3cb04fac-3c35-4c94-8e97-3895ae5dcb3e\"><p local-id=\"659d7d19-d876-4d33-9f8b-769ef3ab9e2f\">By default, latest periodic billing run should load first in the list</p></li><li local-id=\"27b73066-daa8-4da6-a8f2-b8dbb5339b82\"><p local-id=\"be29be33-7d53-44ff-8975-3157c8982def\">By default, it should display 25 records in one page with possibility to change the number of displayed items in a page. Hardcoded values for dropdown: 25, 50, 100</p></li></ol></li><li local-id=\"ddb68038-f8a9-491a-a3b9-975beaa07e43\"><p local-id=\"6d584f85-2b99-426a-9bc9-d5257e837f81\">Periodic Billing run has a defined period in which billing run should be started and ended.</p></li><li local-id=\"895a25a2-ae83-4395-9a95-0f581ecd6909\"><p local-id=\"f8d6e9d2-d012-4bea-a072-99efa1a3f746\">After periodic billing run starts its record should be displayed in the standard billing run&rsquo;s listing</p></li><li local-id=\"423d09dc-30b5-482b-9b30-7c66fa071b0b\"><p local-id=\"876ffbfc-2c25-4e96-9a7e-6d4e8e4811ba\">In each row in Periodic billing run's list should load:</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"a4d8006d-917e-4386-84d8-396201713e9f\"><li local-id=\"c34512c1-4de7-41a9-972e-78ffdda7c1a8\"><p local-id=\"cfd1730e-69f3-49a4-b311-aa8f5be6b215\">Number</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"5c99f0b2-3d68-4952-ba1d-acf7635bf60e\"><li local-id=\"c7de1910-d1bf-4d73-a964-1942854f07c2\"><p local-id=\"cc30141a-16c4-4415-81e4-ab30f00e6551\">Unique number of the billing run</p></li></ol></li><li local-id=\"1e0bbe45-aaf4-4084-b198-6489bd90ba8a\"><p local-id=\"6ca5b55a-8635-4f03-8424-ba61db0b20bc\">Automation</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"14bc7ecb-aa5c-4598-b1e2-a959c7090097\"><li local-id=\"2fcb12ee-ddb9-4217-a331-44f5c70c9807\"><p local-id=\"313290f6-9fcb-4273-b9a3-16f5bfde2a6a\">Generating</p></li><li local-id=\"aae7175e-cf20-4ae3-96d6-a7432b6c559c\"><p local-id=\"73fc9265-1ede-4f5e-a8e4-dbdc44314a63\">Accounting</p></li></ol></li><li local-id=\"237f6c0d-027a-4773-84c8-30ee7988c0c5\"><p local-id=\"66fb6dce-8dc9-4bd2-a1d9-d1f7603f4bd0\">Billing criteria</p></li><li local-id=\"2751d643-2da7-48c7-8629-93ad672b6e82\"><p local-id=\"eefe5ea1-0b77-487b-94af-fd69dace5756\">Application level</p></li><li local-id=\"082cd654-a574-47fe-8ca9-1d600ff05aeb\"><p local-id=\"36433554-df8c-4f1d-ae24-a544671e98c2\">Process periodicity</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"5ebdfd9f-e060-4987-b15c-380eceaaf071\"><li local-id=\"854f6296-72c1-49ac-bb08-b63ecf476d2a\"><p local-id=\"49f7185f-bc2c-4a82-aa62-35370ff86a2d\">Defined period in which this billing run should be started</p></li></ol></li><li local-id=\"f16bdd30-9edc-41b0-b760-924d052bff3a\"><p local-id=\"0a7d0595-f0bb-42af-acec-356fde88ff44\"><span style=\"color: rgb(7,71,166);\">Billing Run Creator</span></p></li><li local-id=\"a75a18fe-cee7-4fd9-bdf6-ed6d75054634\"><p local-id=\"8361ea1a-674b-4b90-8146-fcef2443aba8\"><span style=\"color: rgb(7,71,166);\">Additional information</span></p></li><li local-id=\"3ed78fdd-2a84-4ba8-ab65-f9d4f97be95c\"><p local-id=\"b6ffbbbe-1354-4e44-a6d6-03ee4110fb10\">Actions</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"a6f4a447-c823-46de-a6a2-b106d924afb6\"><li local-id=\"29134baf-0473-4956-882e-60ba5bdb3b0c\"><p local-id=\"a0285f55-12a4-47ad-bd09-929a4f275ac9\">Edit</p></li><li local-id=\"42b1f092-b570-4698-8806-6d791f91516d\"><p local-id=\"529bcac1-8487-4e6e-8017-1ebc20042e4d\">Delete</p></li></ol></li></ol></li><li local-id=\"a13c0bd6-831e-45ec-b717-f2818eca18ba\"><p local-id=\"fafdc66a-3748-4ea6-8686-c0426808d4a6\">To display loader while loading the list</p></li><li local-id=\"1e14159b-3f5f-40f0-83c4-11c39a7cb869\"><p local-id=\"dcdc5bc8-cdbc-45d2-90a7-7f47849942dd\">Search/filter of periodic billing runs:</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"017fe62b-6d12-4a4b-afe5-5ffd0d98df70\"><li local-id=\"ead2c97f-7d6a-453d-8a11-ccd2feacb6fc\"><p local-id=\"5758d317-697a-4775-add5-fca1f15dc219\">To be able to search periodic billing runs by predefined parameters:</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"b1c896d8-fbec-4199-ba97-e75207d52712\"><li local-id=\"6705b7d7-12d8-410d-9338-8415349bb13d\"><p local-id=\"2825e393-ebdb-4991-bf96-4a9287ed2ac0\">Number</p></li><li local-id=\"acc94fd0-4ce2-4795-9896-c584b5325f43\"><p local-id=\"7cf69ad1-c53a-492d-bbbc-90689ae7f44e\">Process Periodicity</p></li><li local-id=\"0c88f7d8-9908-4f3f-a0c7-8fbdfad52dc4\"><p local-id=\"940b29cc-fc2e-4e6c-a6fb-9f86809015c9\"><span style=\"color: rgb(7,71,166);\">Additional information</span></p></li></ol></li><li local-id=\"5b0f47ec-2bd5-48b0-bb12-1c03619e6ea6\"><p local-id=\"e344b0d4-3a11-4ff1-a0c1-f6c4d8af8475\">Min 1 character is required to enable search icon</p></li><li local-id=\"dca3940b-c4fc-4585-b3b8-17b6f06750a6\"><p local-id=\"2f984fd3-9660-469a-923a-87444db958e5\">Empty search box state with gray search/clear icon</p></li><li local-id=\"12248487-7bb7-4d93-84f2-85f919613b89\"><p local-id=\"2ceb2a38-0c20-47ce-a1b6-77fcf1a8f74a\">To be able to click on search icon to run search when min 1 character is typed</p></li><li local-id=\"6e76e38e-e9a0-4046-80ea-c708b58ffa5c\"><p local-id=\"47391596-ac9b-4f4d-bad2-d6406df22aba\">To display loader while loading search results</p></li><li local-id=\"48956f34-1104-4b40-8696-5339ecfc760e\"><p local-id=\"834532fa-2d98-4c83-aad8-042ba7c5f7ec\">To be able to select in which values to search for periodic billing runs</p></li><li local-id=\"c11eb308-1276-4f90-a855-f1ea03ff3f60\"><p local-id=\"cf8addd2-c538-4293-9b85-7139f8bd32cb\">To be able to filter periodic billing runs by:</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"f4fa7e64-2397-4700-8446-8ab0c1c33cca\"><li local-id=\"419ed4c0-97ee-405d-8ac8-a0c01bcad7a0\"><p local-id=\"d4bc1a11-88e5-4c15-a2e7-9ae8809c5488\">Automation (Generating, Accounting)</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"c4e760cc-3aa3-4994-af01-70d09cdf8c33\"><li local-id=\"e57496f5-8ed8-40d7-8995-5c3b16e863dc\"><p local-id=\"0478c0cf-c5b2-4dc1-b53e-fdba67e1cc74\">Multi select dropdown with two hardcoded values:</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"ab3de58e-36bb-4c83-8aa0-017afbe2befc\"><li local-id=\"cb523e53-e566-47ba-bb85-14459fcc54af\"><p local-id=\"e326b667-170f-424b-8f17-890fff61e1c0\">Generating</p></li><li local-id=\"b99df3bc-18b8-46aa-9b97-0c9a29d20033\"><p local-id=\"d3ed450c-5fc8-4090-9f8a-e21bba53f9ee\">Accounting</p></li></ol></li></ol></li><li local-id=\"cf3603e9-02ca-48ab-b2e5-8ecfc8596ddb\"><p local-id=\"7daa6be1-2d07-4a22-b1e9-317bf2410c5e\">Billing criteria</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"1d6a0965-72d8-4ba4-b0b8-dd05216fa1a3\"><li local-id=\"7703429a-2185-45eb-843d-e48cdaaa7df7\"><p local-id=\"c6642b78-8d04-4f80-9859-f69ee818cc03\">Multi select dropdown with three hardcoded values:</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"b5cf81c0-d952-4f9a-8854-40df0643dcae\"><li local-id=\"03415838-46cc-424e-88d4-3ddef3d998e0\"><p local-id=\"eab934d8-95a6-4bc2-92e6-6030c8f74917\">All customers</p></li><li local-id=\"9b86f6f8-be62-4adf-9a0a-c3ace6253585\"><p local-id=\"e12abaa2-a32d-443b-85d5-61335cf3847a\">Customers, contracts, or points of delivery conditions</p></li><li local-id=\"74817a6a-43fb-4200-91bb-8c4cf98aa678\"><p local-id=\"e13aba95-a257-47cf-a535-0cc2e3bcca09\">List of customer, Contracts or Points of delivery</p></li></ol></li><li local-id=\"2e0f1b51-b439-4601-b2c3-b02c51482ff6\"><p local-id=\"5852dae9-b156-47da-ae0d-e165927725c7\">Billing Type</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"e4e4571e-0251-4972-8bec-0bec1392022b\"><li local-id=\"9de54bad-5daf-4074-8140-ddc8970d8430\"><p local-id=\"94ffbbb5-e01c-45ab-a399-58b5d8a0f357\">Standard Billing</p></li><li local-id=\"d121c02d-bcd8-4035-b64e-e67abfa7ef04\"><p local-id=\"b7c1df1c-0185-4dae-a7c2-e32f65949a9d\">Manual interim and advance payment</p></li></ol></li></ol></li><li local-id=\"62ad7586-c7b0-439a-94ea-437188d0b522\"><p local-id=\"8f864bf7-597d-4504-a821-f5d6a33f367d\">Application level</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"60d51f2c-75f6-4df2-b56e-7c7b6e1e1b16\"><li local-id=\"5b755dc6-355f-4925-93e1-37ab05f108aa\"><p local-id=\"d4087edb-2d40-4061-abb7-d23600ee991f\">Multi select dropdown with three hardcoded values:</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"127ea1a3-4a1c-40ec-9ab9-affe4bca71ca\"><li local-id=\"90d94b56-31b2-4cd1-b90f-eee0e7f16436\"><p local-id=\"e999aed0-ee97-42f6-8fa7-c4e6bcd57f84\">Customer</p></li><li local-id=\"12936c60-2bad-4979-8272-ae56e5d15d5a\"><p local-id=\"89cc77e8-672f-4ba2-a689-63f57c204567\">Contract</p></li><li local-id=\"a8d61a57-a440-4778-9c0a-15657f271eed\"><p local-id=\"2fdc76a9-13b0-47ce-a256-0b88d0930601\">POD</p></li></ol></li></ol></li><li local-id=\"abd6e1bb-3828-48ff-b923-35f02faa60a9\"><p local-id=\"b6e00269-b9db-4e8f-8952-b201f8a5456b\">Process periodicity</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"d4820336-7529-4440-ad47-54b2d0d2ef48\"><li local-id=\"e1365f86-fa01-434c-b548-f6414f674ded\"><p local-id=\"9454613c-2483-4a01-839a-ed0fb28bc00b\">Multi select dropdown with listed all Periodicity objects</p></li></ol></li><li local-id=\"d1d38da3-2db1-4a5b-b15d-e9c24e77df0d\"><p local-id=\"f7f70d25-7fa7-4cea-b2db-a195696f929c\">Billing run creator</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"291296fa-fec2-4fbb-a801-4b70626daf88\"><li local-id=\"785b1283-4f9c-4b63-a6a5-3801aa58e9f8\"><p local-id=\"9b74bbe7-007f-47da-8e4b-cf1ecb34a853\"><span style=\"color: rgb(7,71,166);\">Multiselect, dropdown </span></p></li></ol></li></ol></li><li local-id=\"a3b4dedc-ca40-4ee3-855b-baeb9e0c4bfa\"><p local-id=\"e93b57a6-8de4-425a-abe3-c9979af49216\">It is possible to clear filter and keep search results</p></li><li local-id=\"b639c989-8561-49a0-95b8-ef58c2fffae3\"><p local-id=\"6fead9bd-8251-4941-a8f2-cd554114ed4a\">It is possible to clear search result and keep filters</p></li><li local-id=\"9e7f2156-68c7-4193-8127-f33994e4f5d7\"><p local-id=\"6f8c3e70-91b3-4286-80a0-f3e7f671ef70\">Total count of Periodic Billing runs should be loaded</p></li></ol></li><li local-id=\"1b9bc153-a8bd-4b16-904a-11eb7faac68b\"><p local-id=\"ce0064bf-cba7-41aa-820d-8bd7b7f57e42\">Pagination</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"22bf46e0-23d0-446d-9c69-bcc94f3e7c66\"><li local-id=\"5e386a8d-33ee-40b3-938f-f9ec89c19046\"><p local-id=\"750d6360-9246-46ac-99d7-50f4a9cd5b91\">To be able to navigate through next/previous page</p></li><li local-id=\"50dcc03e-5a91-4dfc-b90e-d68fda1d30c7\"><p local-id=\"2a8fa2c9-0a30-43ec-b623-b78bad1e9497\">To be able to navigate to first/last page</p></li><li local-id=\"c105a2b5-8b8e-4779-8500-51456b16697e\"><p local-id=\"deff2c95-3c9d-4763-b4fc-b63d57240e2a\">To be able to use arrow back/forward for navigation</p></li><li local-id=\"160c96dd-85a1-4618-bdd1-c746efab3bfa\"><p local-id=\"39d2d216-ed9c-4056-a66e-eed86ba623d4\">To be able to go to a certain page from dropdown with available pages</p></li><li local-id=\"6e6b04ae-715d-4d7e-bfb9-ba8288856784\"><p local-id=\"af3cf59d-8b07-4be7-9071-1f35b25fa9cc\">To be able to type page number and after clicking on Enter will directly load that page</p></li></ol></li><li local-id=\"e16dcd81-0c96-4c5b-9091-6a9386c46f46\"><p local-id=\"38572bc2-981c-4583-bfce-aa27243cfe9b\">Up/down arrows next to column title for sorting full list</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"b97fb647-8b59-4d8d-91c8-fa94f13d1af4\"><li local-id=\"4e626356-3245-4753-a2fe-76eda0814b00\"><p local-id=\"dd478132-2861-47f2-9fb3-3dca9c48e1fe\">ASC/DESC order</p></li><li local-id=\"37332ba6-cdfe-4b21-a276-c3355602b5a1\"><p local-id=\"eb5c5be0-0b08-4eac-956e-a5516d413700\">All columns should be sortable</p></li></ol></li><li local-id=\"76a484ca-c1f6-421c-a6c7-3f1d7f799361\"><p local-id=\"15a7c88a-9382-4caf-a6e4-1db65ef9e41c\">View Periodic Billing run</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"94102be4-cf77-4b53-b68d-2a87e4baea9e\"><li local-id=\"459e7dd8-e390-424b-a453-4ebd4770704e\"><p local-id=\"4cd75976-d1f8-469f-bec0-27be93d11478\">Clicking on a row will open Periodic Billing run's detail page on read only mode</p></li></ol></li><li local-id=\"411ddb13-d5b6-405a-812a-1248b8c63ff2\"><p local-id=\"d5e1b4dd-ecba-445e-9a1c-900054b54b0a\">Create new Periodic Billing run</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"98f479b0-181e-4dcd-8e1b-939d33cb56a4\"><li local-id=\"7b62df3f-839b-4692-be0f-d8d0b66fc9c6\"><p local-id=\"9c8ecc52-bdd9-42a9-9ea6-a3193c069aff\">Clicking on a Plus icon will open Periodic Billing run's creation page</p></li></ol></li><li local-id=\"d121fe47-369f-4708-a48b-9bb555dfd961\"><p local-id=\"f8b59980-9cd8-4fbd-9c70-3748a992a82f\">Delete Periodic Billing run</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"41354ad2-ece2-42b0-a947-09d728533e33\"><li local-id=\"dded977a-5d66-48bc-8dca-7615c5725193\"><p local-id=\"a61e0539-fd57-4748-9038-a8d06205e052\">For deleting Periodic Billing run user should have permission 'Deleting Periodic Billing Run'</p></li><li local-id=\"f8e8669e-aab2-4b34-b315-c30552c6d879\"><p local-id=\"ab237616-4e07-4ca1-92ab-b04510b1ba94\">It is possible to delete only those billing run which status is Initial</p></li></ol></li><li local-id=\"53484f76-36ea-4bb7-abb6-36b2bbe6d4d2\"><p local-id=\"37886329-dbe1-48ab-bb4b-72231aa01f73\">Edit Periodic Billing run</p><ol start=\"1\" local-id=\"19b0b20d-8f66-4c83-81e8-2e5e7f504340\"><li local-id=\"1939875e-0ad0-4463-aebd-54957ef6de4a\"><p local-id=\"f90ee294-1cb7-40d7-834e-e59c07176f2d\">Edit icon will be always visible and active</p></li><li local-id=\"7b0ee2de-0739-4cf5-aad0-3e33c0fe4e61\"><p local-id=\"ea8dbbc3-ab66-47f0-87db-c4a3cf9d5095\">Clicking on an edit icon will open detailed page in editing mode</p></li><li local-id=\"ab907eb6-3fb2-4345-b161-3aa3821de583\"><p local-id=\"26f87591-8c2c-4d0a-a904-21e0312dc7c2\">If Billing run has already started (it doesn't matter if there are only draft invoices generated on real ones) it is not possible to edit such billing run</p></li></ol></li><li local-id=\"15a822cd-133d-41ef-b4de-6c0bd8de51ce\"><p local-id=\"f1339f08-a4a4-413d-af26-cb53748cd6c4\">Audit Log record should be created</p></li></ol><p local-id=\"a312ef79-0e3a-46a3-a5ee-3811c1b5ef7e\">&nbsp;</p>","representation":"storage","embeddedContent":[],"_expandable":{"content":"/rest/api/content/27132055"}},"_expandable":{"editor":"","atlas_doc_format":"","view":"","export_view":"","styled_view":"","markdown":"","dynamic":"","editor2":"","anonymous_export_view":""}},"extensions":{"position":815},"_expandable":{"container":"/rest/api/space/Phoenix","metadata":"","restrictions":"/rest/api/content/27132055/restriction/byOperation","history":"/rest/api/content/27132055/history","version":"","descendants":"/rest/api/content/27132055/descendant","space":"/rest/api/space/Phoenix","childTypes":"","schedulePublishInfo":"","operations":"","schedulePublishDate":"","children":"/rest/api/content/27132055/child","ancestors":"","draftVersion":""},"_links":{"editui":"/pages/resumedraft.action?draftId=27132055","webui":"/spaces/Phoenix/pages/27132055/Periodic+Billing+Run+-+Listing","edituiv2":"/spaces/Phoenix/pages/edit-v2/27132055","context":"/wiki","self":"https://asterbit.atlassian.net/wiki/rest/api/content/27132055","tinyui":"/x/lwCeAQ","collection":"/rest/api/content","base":"https://asterbit.atlassian.net/wiki"}}